to Creative Commons, PO Box 1866, Mountain View, CA 94042, USA.

### Attribution

The Wahl-O-Mat theses originate from the Bundeszentrale für politische
Bildung (bpb). The original dataset is available at
https://www.bpb.de/themen/wahl-o-mat/556865/datensaetze-des-wahl-o-mat/.
When using the data, please attribute both this repository and the bpb as
the original source of the Wahl-O-Mat theses.

### Third-party data

The `data/human_annotation/` directory contains generated model outputs and
judge scores produced for this study. It contains no personal data.